on identity changes (disconnect, reconnect, probe or target override), or when hardware identity may have changed (identity repair or destructive recovery).\"}, \"next_call\": {\"arguments\": {\"board_id\": \"nrf_b\", \"probe_id\": \"683854191\"}, \"tool\": \"board_validate\"}, \"redirect\": \"Continue by calling board_validate for board 'nrf_b'.\", \"status\": \"setup_tool_loaded\", \"tool_name\": \"board_validate\"}"}]}}
